{"t":"PFE","n":"Pfizer Inc.","nKo":"화이자","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":27.4,"chg":0.0,"chgPct":0.0,"prev":27.4,"dayH":27.68,"dayL":27.31,"w52H":31.44,"w52L":23.62,"vol":28723818,"avgVol":34228490,"mcap":156175990784,"pe":39.14,"fpe":9.28,"eps":0.7,"feps":2.95,"pb":1.75,"div":1.72,"divY":0.0628,"beta":0.3,"short":134422620,"shortPct":0.0236,"shortRatio":4.45,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Healthcare","sKo":"헬스케어","i":"Drug Manufacturers - General","iKo":"의약품 제조업체 - 일반","city":"New York","emp":75000,"web":"https://www.pfizer.com","sum":"Pfizer Inc. discovers, develops, manufactures, markets, distributes, and sells biopharmaceutical products in the United States and internationally. It operates in three segments: Biopharma, PC1, and Pfizer Ignite. The company offers internal medicine products, including cardiovascular metabolic diseases products under the Eliquis brand; migraine products under the Nurtec ODT/Vydura and Zavzpret brand; vaccines under the Prevnar family, Abrysvo, Nimenrix, FSME/IMMUN-TicoVac, and Trumenba brands; and Paxlovid for the treatment of COVID-19. It also provides inflammation and immunology products, such as Xeljanz, Enbrel, Cibinqo, Litfulo, Eucrisa, and Velsipity; rare disease products for therapeutic areas comprising amyloidosis, hemophilia, and endocrine diseases under the Vyndaqel family, Geno","sumKo":"Pfizer Inc.는 미국 및 해외에서 바이오의약품을 발견, 개발, 제조, 마케팅, 유통 및 판매합니다. Biopharma, PC1 및 Pfizer Ignite의 세 가지 부문으로 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 Eliquis 브랜드로 심혈관 대사 질환 제품을 포함한 내과 제품을 제공합니다. Nurtec ODT/Vydura 및 Zavzpret 브랜드의 편두통 제품; Prevnar 제품군, Abrysvo, Nimenrix, FSME/IMMUN-TicoVac 및 Trumenba 브랜드의 백신; 그리고 코로나19 치료를 위한 Paxlovid. 또한 Xeljanz, Enbrel, Cibinqo, Litfulo, Eucrisa 및 Velsipity와 같은 염증 및 면역학 제품을 제공합니다. 제노 빈다켈 계열 아밀로이드증, 혈우병, 내분비질환 치료분야용 희귀질환 제품"},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":100330000000,"ni":31372000000},{"y":2023,"rev":58496000000,"ni":2119000000},{"y":2024,"rev":63627000000,"ni":8031000000},{"y":2025,"rev":62579000000,"ni":7771000000}],"quarterl